To pass audio inputs to vLLM for multimodal inference, you can use the `audio` field in the multimodal dictionary. For example:

```python
inputs = {
    "prompt": prompt_with_audio,
    "multi_modal_data": {
        "audio": audio,
    }
}
```

This allows vLLM to handle audio inputs as part of the multimodal input configuration.
